---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import PhoneMockup from '../components/PhoneMockup.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Our Work"
  description="Real rebrands and digital strategy for Acadiana businesses — The Floor Factory, Infiniti Investigations, Nano Ceramic Protect South, and Wave Installations."
>
  <section class="bg-navy relative overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/images/logo/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="" class="pointer-events-none select-none absolute -right-20 -top-16 w-72 opacity-[0.06]" />
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-20 pb-16 text-center">
      <p class="caps text-gold text-xs tracking-[0.25em] mb-5">Our Work</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-cream text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-6 leading-tight">
        Problems We&rsquo;ve Solved, Not Just Graphics We&rsquo;ve Made
      </h1>
      <p class="text-cream/75 text-[16px] max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Every one of these started with the same question: what does this business actually need? Here&rsquo;s what came out of answering it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-24 space-y-20">

    <!-- Floor Factory -->
    <article>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2">
        <h2 class="font-display text-navy text-2xl sm:text-3xl">The Floor Factory</h2>
        <span class="caps text-[11px] text-gold tracking-[0.15em]">Branding &middot; Website &middot; Social Setup</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-ink-soft text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
        Clarified the company&rsquo;s emphasis on custom flooring and installation, modernized brand presentation, optimized website messaging and page descriptions, improved mobile and desktop content, and established a new Facebook presence.
      </p>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <figure class="bg-white border border-navy/10 rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
          <img src="/images/work/floor-factory-before.jpg" alt="The Floor Factory's original framed logo and business card" class="w-full h-64 object-cover" />
          <figcaption class="caps text-[11px] text-ink-soft tracking-[0.15em] px-4 py-3 border-t border-navy/10">Before</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bg-black rounded-sm overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/images/work/floor-factory-logo.svg" alt="The Floor Factory's new logo" class="w-full h-64 object-contain p-8" />
          <figcaption class="sr-only">After</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Infiniti Investigations -->
    <article>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2">
        <h2 class="font-display text-navy text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Infiniti Investigations</h2>
        <span class="caps text-[11px] text-gold tracking-[0.15em]">Full Rebrand</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-ink-soft text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
        A full identity refresh — from a dated, clip-art-style wordmark to a clean, modern black, white, and red identity built to read as a professional investigations firm at a glance.
      </p>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <figure class="bg-white border border-navy/10 rounded-sm overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/images/work/infiniti-old-logo.png" alt="Infiniti Investigations' original logo" class="w-full h-56 object-contain p-8" />
          <figcaption class="sr-only">Before</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bg-black rounded-sm overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <img src="/images/work/infiniti-logo.svg" alt="Infiniti Investigations' new logo" class="w-full h-56 object-contain p-10" />
          <figcaption class="sr-only">After</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Nano Ceramic Protect South -->
    <article class="grid sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-8 items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2">
          <h2 class="font-display text-navy text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Nano Ceramic Protect South</h2>
          <span class="caps text-[11px] text-gold tracking-[0.15em]">Website &middot; E-Commerce &middot; Content Strategy</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-ink-soft text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Website and Shopify optimization, product organization, service positioning, e-commerce strategy, branded social content, product photography and video, and overall digital strategy.
        </p>
      </div>
      <PhoneMockup src="/images/work/nano-screenshot.jpg" alt="Nano Ceramic Protect South's website shown on a phone screen" fit="cover" />
    </article>

    <!-- Wave Installations -->
    <article class="grid sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-8 items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2">
          <h2 class="font-display text-navy text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Wave Installations</h2>
          <span class="caps text-[11px] text-gold tracking-[0.15em]">Branding &middot; Social Media</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-ink-soft text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Brand identity, messaging, and an active Instagram presence for a home security and smart-technology installer — security cameras, monitored alarms, access control, networking, home audio, and lighting and shade automation — built around the line &ldquo;Securing your space, installing your tech.&rdquo;
        </p>
      </div>
      <PhoneMockup src="/images/work/wave-screenshot.jpg" alt="Wave Installations' Instagram profile shown on a phone screen" fit="cover" />
    </article>

  </section>

  <CtaBand
    heading="Want Results Like These?"
    body="Every project on this page started with a conversation, not a package. Let's have that conversation about your business."
  />
</Layout>
